# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command touch
usage 1   touch <path>                  create an empty file, or update an existing one's modified time

case a new file, an old one and failures
target none
covers 1
$ touch new.txt
out 0

status 0
action none
$ ls
out 55
Cheats/
Firmware/
Games/
Logs/
Saves/
etc/
new.txt
tmp/
status 0
action none
$ touch new.txt
out 0

status 0
action none
$ touch
out 26
touch: usage: touch <path>
status 1
action none
$ touch /../x
out 54
touch: '/../x' is outside the project sandbox (<ROOT>)
status 1
action none
$ touch Logs
out 28
touch: 'Logs' is a directory
status 1
action none
$ touch sub/dir/file.txt
out 67
touch: Could not find a part of the path '<ROOT>/sub/dir/file.txt'.
status 1
action none
end
